What is printed?
```
int units = 250, bill;
if (units <= 100)
    bill = units * 5;
else if (units <= 200)
    bill = 500 + (units - 100) * 8;
else
    bill = 1300 + (units - 200) * 10;
printf("%d", bill);
```

